title: ReplacementSlot (MF-05)
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> WAITING_PAYMENT : resignation confirmed, fee not yet paid
  [*] --> OPEN : resignation confirmed, fee paid
  WAITING_PAYMENT --> OPEN : Client pays service fee
  OPEN --> FILLED : replacement candidate placed (no new fee)
  OPEN --> EXPIRED : fill window ended
  OPEN --> CANCELLED : Client / Admin cancels
  WAITING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED : cancelled
  FILLED --> [*]
  EXPIRED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
